  "methodology": "Continuous interaction excludes compilation. Each scenario dispatches 60 real UI events; records animation-frame intervals, input-to-next-layout latency, main-thread long tasks and bitmap uploads. The final sharp DPR paint is awaited; Canvas coverage, overview clipping and memory bounds are checked. These are UI scheduling measurements, not a physical display refresh-rate guarantee. Source-edit and raster timings are measured separately with other validation processes stopped.",
